---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import familyPhoto from '../assets/jake-family.jpg';
---

<section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[var(--content-max)] px-[var(--section-x)] py-[var(--section-y)] reveal">
  <h2 class="font-display type-h2 mb-6 text-ink">About</h2>
  <p class="prose-body mb-4 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-ink">
    I live in Orange County with my wife Kinsey and our four kids. Most of my work sits at the intersection of strategy, people, and the operating system of a business.
  </p>
  <p class="prose-body mb-4 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-ink">
    Before consulting, I served as a U.S. Army officer and led operations in complex environments. I later completed USC Marshall's Master of Business for Veterans program and built a practice helping leadership teams get clear and execute.
  </p>
  <p class="prose-body mb-8 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-ink">
    I am building in the marketplace as a founder and advisor. If you are navigating growth, succession, or a stuck leadership team, I am easy to reach.
  </p>
  <Image
    src={familyPhoto}
    alt="Jake with Kinsey and their four kids."
    width={900}
    loading="lazy"
    class="w-full rounded-xl object-cover"
  />
</section>
